[
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "# 16_Linux_Server_e_Amministrazione",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "📋 Panoramica",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "Amministrazione di server Linux con Debian/Ubuntu. Copre installazione, comandi essenziali, gestione utenti/permessi, SSH, DNS, web server (Apache/Nginx), MySQL/MariaDB, PHP, firewall (iptables/nftables), shell avanzata (grep, sed, awk), strumenti di diagnostica, networking Linux, WordPress deployment, cron e automazione. Docente: Wolfgang Cecchin.",
      "block_property": "paragraph"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "📚 Indice degli argomenti",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "1. Installazione e Architetture",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Architetture server**: Fisico, VM, Container, Cloud, Serverless",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Distribuzioni Linux**: Famiglie RedHat (Fedora/CentOS), Debian (Ubuntu), SuSE, Arch, Gentoo",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Installazione Debian**: Partizionamento, LVM, filesystem, pacchetti base",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**VM su VMware/VirtualBox/KVM**: Setup e configurazione",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "2. Comandi Essenziali",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Struttura comandi**: `comando [opzioni] [parametri]` (es. `ls -lah /home`)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Filesystem**: `/`, `/home`, `/etc`, `/var`, `/tmp`, `/usr`, `/bin`, `/sbin`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Shell**: bash, autocomplete (Tab), history (↑↓), `CTRL+D` (logout), `CTRL+C` (interrompi)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**File operazioni**: `touch`, `cat`, `nano`/`vi`, `cp`, `mv`, `rm`, `mkdir`, `chmod`, `chown`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Redirezione**: `>` (sovrascrivi), `>>` (append), `|` (pipe)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Manuali**: `man comando`, `comando --help`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "3. Utenti, Permessi e SSH",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Utenti**: `useradd`, `usermod`, `userdel`, `passwd`, `/etc/passwd`, `/etc/shadow`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Permessi**: rwx (444/644/755/700), `chmod` (ottale e simbolico), `chown`, `chgrp`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**SU e Sudo**: `su - utente`, configurazione `/etc/sudoers`, gruppo `sudo`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Permessi speciali**: SUID (4xxx), SGID (2xxx), Sticky Bit (1xxx)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**SSH**: `ssh user@host`, chiavi pubbliche/private (Ed25519/RSA), `~/.ssh/authorized_keys`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Configurazione SSH**: `/etc/ssh/sshd_config`, porta, PermitRootLogin, PasswordAuthentication",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "4. DNS e Nomi Host",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**hostname**: `hostnamectl`, `/etc/hostname`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**/etc/hosts**: Risoluzione locale nomi-IP",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**DNS client**: `/etc/resolv.conf`, `systemd-resolved`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**named (BIND)**: Concetti base, zone file",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "5. Web Server (Apache/Nginx)",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Apache2**: Installazione, `sites-available`/`sites-enabled`, VirtualHost, `.htaccess`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Moduli**: mod_rewrite, mod_ssl, mod_proxy",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Nginx**: Configurazione, server blocks, proxy inverso, SSL/TLS",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Esercizi**: Hosting multiplo, HTTPS self-signed, reverse proxy PHP",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "6. Database MySQL/MariaDB",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Installazione**: `apt install mariadb-server`, `mysql_secure_installation`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Comandi SQL**: `CREATE DATABASE`, `CREATE USER`, `GRANT`, `SELECT`, `INSERT`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Backup/Ripristino**: `mysqldump`, `mysql < backup.sql`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**WordPress**: Configurazione LAMP/LNMP, `wp-config.php`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "7. PHP",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Installazione**: `php`, `php-fpm`, `php-mysql`, moduli comuni",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Configurazione**: `php.ini`, pooling FPM, integrazione con Apache/Nginx",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "8. Shell Avanzata e Scripting",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**grep, sed, awk**: Ricerca, sostituzione, elaborazione testo",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**find**: Ricerca avanzata file (nome, tipo, dimensione, data)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Espressioni regolari**: Pattern matching in grep/sed/awk",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Cron e at**: Pianificazione task ricorrenti (`crontab -e`) e singoli (`at`)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Script bash**: `#!/bin/bash`, variabili, `if/for/while`, funzioni",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "9. Networking e Firewall",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Schede di rete**: `ip a`, `ip route`, `ss`, `ping`, `traceroute`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Firewall**: `iptables`/`nftables`, catene, regole, NAT, port forwarding",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Diagnostica**: `tcpdump`, `netstat`, `ss`, `lsof`, `nslookup`, `dig`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Networking Linux**: Bridge, bonding, VLAN su Linux",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "10. Diagnostica e Monitoraggio",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**glances**: Monitoraggio sistema completo (CPU, RAM, disco, rete)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Strumenti diagnostici**: `dmesg`, `journalctl`, `top`/`htop`, `df`/`du`, `free`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Troubleshooting**: `strace`, `lsof`, `systemctl status`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "11. Deployment WordPress",
      "block_property": "heading_3"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Architettura due macchine**: Web server + DB server separati",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Configurazione**: VirtualHost, database remoto, permalink, sicurezza",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Esercizi**: Migrazione, backup, aggiornamento",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "⚡ Punti Chiave",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**Debian** è la distribuzione di riferimento per il corso (famiglia stable/testing)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "Distinguere tra permessi **ottali** (chmod 755) e **simbolici** (chmod u+x)",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**SSH con chiavi** è più sicuro della password — usare `ssh-keygen -t ed25519`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "`iptables` è legacy → **nftables** è il successore moderne",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**mysqldump** è essenziale per backup DB: `mysqldump -u root -p db > backup.sql`",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "Il piping (`|`) è il cuore della filosofia Unix — componi comandi semplici",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "WordPress: configurare permalink e .htaccess subito dopo installazione",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "📎 Risorse Collegate",
      "block_property": "heading_2"
    }
  },
  {
    "content_block": {
      "content": "**02_Esercizi/**: Esercizi su utenti/permessi, ripasso meta-corso, find, grep/sed/awk",
      "block_property": "bulleted_list_item"
    }
